      en: ["Construction began in 1658 after the Treaty of Roskilde.", "Built from massive granite blocks.", "Strategic location for the defense of Marstrand.", "Served as a prison for up to 500 inmates.", "Lasse-Maja was the most famous prisoner held here.", "Currently listed as a national historic monument."],
