      en: ["The tower stands 117.6 meters tall with 35 floors.", "Completed in September 2011.", "Architectural design by Wingårdhs Arkitektkontor.", "Features a signature sky bar on the 34th floor.", "The glass exterior consists of roughly 8,000 triangular panes.", "It is the tallest hotel building in Northern Europe."],
